@startuml

scale 3

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 4

skinparam nodesep 110
skinparam ranksep 70

skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1
skinparam ArrowFontColor #111827
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

skinparam StateBorderColor #334155
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam StateFontColor #111827
skinparam StateFontSize 13
skinparam StateFontStyle bold

skinparam StateAttributeFontSize 11
skinparam StateAttributeFontStyle plain
skinparam StateAttributeFontColor #475569

skinparam StateStartColor #111827
skinparam StateEndColor #111827

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #111827
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
  AttributeFontSize 11
  AttributeFontStyle plain
  AttributeFontColor #475569
  RoundCorner 4
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor transparent
  BorderColor transparent
  FontColor #111827
  FontName "Arial"
  FontSize 11
}

top to bottom direction

state Final <<end>>

state Requested
Requested : Lock: Held

state Rejected
Rejected : Lock: Released

state Approved
Approved : Lock: Held

state Cancelled
Cancelled : Lock: Released

state Repaid
Repaid : Lock: Released


Rejected -[hidden]right-> Approved
Approved -[hidden]right-> Cancelled

Requested -[hidden]down-> Approved
Approved -[hidden]down-> Repaid
Repaid -[hidden]down-> Final


[*] -down-> Requested : requestLoan()\n/ hold lock


Requested -down-> Approved
note right on link
approveLoan()
[checks pass]
end note


Requested -down-> Rejected
note left on link
approveLoan()
[checks fail]
/ release lock
end note


Requested -[norank]-> Rejected
note left on link
rejectLoan()
/ release lock
end note


Requested -[norank]-> Cancelled
note right on link
cancelLoan()
/ release lock
end note


Approved -down-> Repaid
note right on link
repay()
/ release lock
end note


Rejected -[norank]-> Final
Repaid -down-> Final
Cancelled -[norank]-> Final

@enduml